# proptest failure-seed caches (written next to a test on any proptest failure). Deliberately
# never checked in: a failing seed is a bug to fix locally, and the fix belongs in a deterministic
# regression test beside the code. Checking the cache in instead would re-run that one input
# forever and go stale the moment the bug is fixed.
*.proptest-regressions

# generated by guide/build.sh (version + commit stamp, included via {{#include}})
/guide/src/version.md
/guide-zh/src/version.md